# oodac — compiler
File: website/pulled/oodac.oot

Source: openOODA/oodac/docs/

## What it is

The sovereign compiler. Tag v0.2.11. Lexer, parser,
typecheck, capability check, and emit-c / emit-llvm.

Backends (today): C99 (links oodar, the default build);
LLVM IR (in active development, the default build target
once the LLVM phase lands).
Planned (per openOODA/docs/ROADMAP.oot, not yet built):
ELF64 (x86_64, AArch64), WebAssembly, GPU (HIP/PTX/Metal/SPIR-V).

The compiler is the substrate. std, ooda, lsp, mcp, and opm
consume it. They are siblings, not children of a monorepo.
`ooda build` and `ooda run` exec this binary via
`OODA_COMPILER`.

## Surface

6 public subdirs (from `oodac/ANCHOR.oo`):

| Dir | Role |
|-----|------|
| `lex/` | Scanner |
| `ast/` | Parser and Merkle AST |
| `check/` | Caps, typestate, SMT, typecheck |
| `types/` | Type IR |
| `emit/` | C99 + LLVM IR (emit/c/, emit/llvm/) |
| `cli/` | `oodac` command surface |

Tooling subdirs (not in the public surface; build, test, doc):
`bin/`, `bootstrap/`, `docs/`, `qa/`, `scripts/`, `tests/`.

Do not copy `./bin/ooda` onto `./oodac/oodac`.
